OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F359A1783970291
OL,3,CNowacki wins gold in the 200m
OL,4,Cbreaststroke
OL,6,FJersey's Filip Nowacki has won his
OL,7,Ffirst British senior title after
OL,8,Fclaiming gold in the 200m breaststroke
OL,9,Fat the Aquatics GB Swimming
OL,10,FChampionships.
OL,12,FThe 18-year-old was victorious with a
OL,13,Ftime of 2:08:52, shy of his 2:07:00
OL,14,Ftarget, but still nearly a second
OL,15,Fquicker than last year's champion Greg
OL,16,FButler who placed second, followed by
OL,17,FChristian Ryan in third.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/6
