PN,35902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F359A1783970291
OL,3,CNowacki wins gold in the 200m
OL,4,Cbreaststroke
OL,6,FSpeaking after his race on Saturday
OL,7,F(18 April), Nowacki told Aquatics GB:
OL,8,F"I am over the moon, buzzing, ecstatic
OL,9,Fand really pleased with how the week
OL,10,Fhas gone."
OL,12,FNowacki's gold comes days after he
OL,13,Fqualified for the European
OL,14,FChampionships in Paris this August,
OL,15,Frecording the third-fastest 100m
OL,16,Fbreaststroke time in the world this
OL,17,Fyear as he finished just behind triple
OL,18,FOlympic champion Adam Peaty.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBCh Is Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,360,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F359A1783970291
OL,3,CNowacki wins gold in the 200m
OL,4,Cbreaststroke
OL,6,FThe Jersey swimmer will also represent
OL,7,Fthe island at the Commonwealth Games
OL,8,Fin Glasgow in July and told Aquatics
OL,9,FGB he needs to keep working hard to
OL,10,Fimprove.
OL,12,FNowacki explains: "I just need to see
OL,13,Fif I can step it up again from the
OL,14,FCommonwealth to the Europeans like I
OL,15,Fhave done in the past, and really give
OL,16,Fit my best shot."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/6
