PN,35904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F359A1783970291
OL,3,CNowacki wins gold in the 200m
OL,4,Cbreaststroke
OL,6,FPeaty beat Nowacki by four-tenths of a
OL,7,Fsecond during the British
OL,8,FChampionships final on Tuesday (14
OL,9,FApril), but admitted that the
OL,10,Fteenager, who is 13 years his junior,
OL,11,Fhas a bright future.
OL,13,FHe told Aquatics GB: "I tell you what,
OL,14,Fwe've got some talented youngsters
OL,15,Fcoming through the sport, especially
OL,16,Fin this event, so I know when I do
OL,17,Fretire one day, this event's safe."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'R(,,,,,,,,,,,,
