FL,360,380,250,120,000,100
PN,35905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F359A1783970291
OL,3,CNowacki wins gold in the 200m
OL,4,Cbreaststroke
OL,6,FThe 18-year-old Jerseyman added that
OL,7,Fhe likes the challenge of facing such
OL,8,Fan elite sportsperson, saying: "I am
OL,9,Fenjoying pushing him, just as much as
OL,10,Fhe is kind of pulling me along and
OL,11,Fpulling the rest of us along."
OL,13,FCommenting on the race, Aquatics GB
OL,14,Fpresenter Dan Jervis said: "The things
OL,15,Fyou (Fillip) are going to do in the
OL,16,Ffuture is just going to be amazing.
OL,18,F"He should be so happy, he got all his
OL,19,Fprocesses right, he got the turns
OL,20,Fright, the length of stroke right.
OL,26,@wD@EpmwD@Lpn
