OL,3,CNowacki wins gold in the 200m
OL,4,Cbreaststroke
OL,6,F"We were expecting something special
OL,7,Fand boy did he deliver, I cannot wait
OL,8,Fto see what he is going to do this
OL,9,Fsummer in Paris."
